/**
 * NerdMiner-Modded Local Configuration Overrides Example
 *
 * To bake your personal WiFi credentials, Bitcoin wallet, and mining pool directly
 * into firmware binaries on compilation (no SD card or captive portal setup needed):
 *
 * 1. Copy this file to "src/config.local.h":
 *    cp src/config.local.h.example src/config.local.h
 *
 * 2. Uncomment and adjust the settings below.
 *
 * 3. Build and flash the firmware:
 *    pio run -e ESP32-2432S028R -t upload
 *
 * "src/config.local.h" is ignored by git, keeping your secrets safe from commits.
 */

